# -------------------------
# graphify
# -------------------------
# Entirely derived from the sources in this repo, so none of it belongs in VCS.
# graph.json is several MB of single-line JSON rewritten in full on every
# `graphify update .`, which would add a new blob per run and produce diffs
# nobody can read. Rebuild locally with /graphify instead.
graphify-out/
